# Mail Proxy URL (Optional)
# If set, Mail.js will use this URL as API proxy instead of api.mail.tm
# This is useful when deploying to Cloudflare Pages to avoid CORS issues
#
# Steps:
# 1. Deploy the worker from workers/mail-proxy/index.js to Cloudflare Workers
# 2. Copy the worker URL (e.g., https://mail-proxy.your-subdomain.workers.dev)
# 3. Paste the URL below
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAIL_PROXY_URL=https://mail-proxy.your-subdomain.workers.dev
